                            "неол. совокупность знаний о вымышленном мире какого-либо художественного произведения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76ed9fa8-b5d6-40c9-980d-e391c0a6f93d",
                                "sense_id": "9fb977c0-6327-3ff9-8f9b-1898aa5b3234",
                                "text": "Огромный и продуманный мир, который имеет богатую историю. Разные расы и их истории. Тут даже есть своеобразная магия, которую прозвали «Эффект массы». Древние расы, искусственный интеллект, древние технологии, проблемы галактического масштаба, древние строения. Всё это подпитано интересной историей и лором. Ведь что ещё нужно для хорошего мира?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dd6cdd8-5b98-4f91-ab19-2ec697032aac",
                                "sense_id": "9fb977c0-6327-3ff9-8f9b-1898aa5b3234",
                                "text": "В отличие от сеттинга (обобщённого описания жанра и декораций), лор или бэкграунд истории — более широкое понятие. Лор (или иначе бэкграунд) более детально описывает декорации, предметы и оружие, которые используют в своей истории главные герои."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5503d6a2-8ad7-4ae4-9373-2b0d79874dc2",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fbd751b-2f20-3a6d-a590-ed4b47e3197c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9fb977c0-6327-3ff9-8f9b-1898aa5b3234",
                        "target_lang_word": "lore",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lore",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f249b18-b5ca-3aa2-899b-d55c50441ecf",
                                        "entry_id": "3ccdeba5-c69a-316d-b0e6-b97f99f0fe4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "All the facts and traditions about a particular subject that have been accumulated over time through education or experience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9610260c-5fa8-4266-a989-4376a75757a8",
                                                "sense_id": "1f249b18-b5ca-3aa2-899b-d55c50441ecf",
                                                "text": "the recondite lore of the Ancient Egyptians"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c122313-b2a3-4723-b877-ca3defff54c8",
                                                "sense_id": "1f249b18-b5ca-3aa2-899b-d55c50441ecf",
                                                "text": "He to them calles and speakes, yet nought avayles; / They heare him not, they have forgot his lore / But go which way they list; their guide they have forelore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d031d55-6e43-330e-9e5b-ff640e4a8bc4",
                                        "entry_id": "3ccdeba5-c69a-316d-b0e6-b97f99f0fe4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The backstory, especially for a character or setting, created around a fictional universe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33b7efdd-18d4-408f-a4f5-c187119cee34",
                                                "sense_id": "7d031d55-6e43-330e-9e5b-ff640e4a8bc4",
                                                "text": "Lore documents reveal that she was backstabbed by her subordinate, who wanted to become king, and she feels vengeful about it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef9049e7-bfae-4abb-8bd6-7980fdf6c616",
                                                "sense_id": "7d031d55-6e43-330e-9e5b-ff640e4a8bc4",
                                                "text": "You might have stumbled upon discussions of Bloodborne's lore - there are plenty of discussions about Bloodborne's lore - which can be more than a little dense and, to the outsider, off-putting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71a22420-ea6e-38e9-bf6d-173b70aa940f",
                                        "entry_id": "3ccdeba5-c69a-316d-b0e6-b97f99f0fe4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The backstory, especially for a character or setting, created around a fictional universe.",
                                            "Trivia shared by a person about themself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "054d3c57-aded-47da-9bcb-5b8ae11c852e",
                                                "sense_id": "71a22420-ea6e-38e9-bf6d-173b70aa940f",
                                                "text": "It's Ashot lore that I used to have a priv where I posted pictures of weird animals I found on the street."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "457624d9-1a52-424e-9d61-f5465d24e307",
                                                "sense_id": "71a22420-ea6e-38e9-bf6d-173b70aa940f",
                                                "text": "Most new followers don't know about my marching band lore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac204110-1ff1-34bd-9bd5-81a2174b104f",
                                        "entry_id": "3ccdeba5-c69a-316d-b0e6-b97f99f0fe4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Workmanship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6101c4b6-2a15-4b54-84c1-13a81667a95f",
                                                "sense_id": "ac204110-1ff1-34bd-9bd5-81a2174b104f",
                                                "text": "In her right hand a rod of peace shee bore, / About the which two serpents weren wound; / Entrayled mutually in lovely lore, / And by the tailes together firmely bound […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
