                                                "sense_id": "41bb6923-70ae-3e27-80a9-f50290bef73a",
                                                "text": "He’s sticky and encrusted on one side below his beak and amongst the lores around his eyes by the pips and juices he has dined upon, the pith and pulp of feeding."
